{
    "title": "Cyber Music Rush",
    "description": "Let's give a warm round of applause for Durple the Purple Dragon, straight from Incredible Sprunki! He loves collecting and playing trumpets with the Sprunki Group. Want to hear the latest remix from him and his Sprunki friends? Take a listen:\r\n\r\nHello! Would you like to have some fun? With us, right now! Come on, come sing along with us, in this fun time!\r\n\r\n<b><h1>MUSIC GAME WITH PIANO TAPPING, RHYTHM, BEATS & REAL MUSIC</h1></b> \r\nAre you looking for a new music game with tap gameplay and real music?\r\nWanna play a music game with cool drumbeats, guitar strings and other music instruments more than piano?\r\n\r\nMeet <font color=\"\u201dred\u201d\">Cyber Music Rush</font> which is a free piano game that combines hyper-casual gaming with music. Feel positive vibes when you tap through the music tiles of the piano game and uplift your mood with some funky tunes. Complete all levels with all 3 stars by tapping the tiles of the piano music game at the right moment.\r\n\r\n<b><h2>FEEL THE MUSIC NOTES WHILE TAPPING</h2></b>\r\nIn this piano player game, you need to tap on the right music tiles without touching anything wrong. If you misplace your taps, you will lose one of the 3 lives you have for all levels. Show that you can follow the piano melody and pass all levels in one of the best piano games with real songs.\r\n\r\n <b>UNIQUE MELODIES AND POPULAR SONGS</b>\r\nThe beautiful piano game features mesmerizing EDM-inspired graphics and upbeat music. In this fun piano game for kids and adults, there are many famous reworks included. But unlike most piano games where there is a combo of piano and EDM, here there are also realistic drums and other instruments.\r\n\r\n<b>UNLOCK NEW SONGS</b>\r\nCollect stars with quick tapping after you successfully complete levels in the instrument rhythm game. Use them to unlock new packs of interesting songs that will play in the rhythm of the EDM game.\r\n\r\n <font color=\"\u201dblue\u201d\">TAP PIANO GAME FEATURES: </font>\r\n- simple tap gameplay\r\n- piano, drums, instrument game \r\n- tap in the best spot at the right moment for extra points\r\n- collect stars to unlock new song packs\r\n- play the piano game online or offline (fun game for your travel, commute time, or anywhere where internet/mobile data is not available)\r\n\r\nNow don\u2019t miss one of the best EDM music games of 2022! \r\n\r\n<b>Download Edm Music & Piano Game for FREE</b>\r\n\r\n\r\n------------------------\r\n<u>REACH OUT</u> \r\n- If some of the songs, labels, or images in our melody game are a subject of a dispute, don\u2019t hesitate to contact us",
    "descriptionHTML": "Let&#39;s give a warm round of applause for Durple the Purple Dragon, straight from Incredible Sprunki! He loves collecting and playing trumpets with the Sprunki Group. Want to hear the latest remix from him and his Sprunki friends? Take a listen:<br><br>Hello! Would you like to have some fun? With us, right now! Come on, come sing along with us, in this fun time!<br><br><b><h1>MUSIC GAME WITH PIANO TAPPING, RHYTHM, BEATS &amp; REAL MUSIC</h1></b> <br>Are you looking for a new music game with tap gameplay and real music?<br>Wanna play a music game with cool drumbeats, guitar strings and other music instruments more than piano?<br><br>Meet <font color=\"\u201dred\u201d\">Cyber Music Rush</font> which is a free piano game that combines hyper-casual gaming with music. Feel positive vibes when you tap through the music tiles of the piano game and uplift your mood with some funky tunes. Complete all levels with all 3 stars by tapping the tiles of the piano music game at the right moment.<br><br><b><h2>FEEL THE MUSIC NOTES WHILE TAPPING</h2></b><br>In this piano player game, you need to tap on the right music tiles without touching anything wrong. If you misplace your taps, you will lose one of the 3 lives you have for all levels. Show that you can follow the piano melody and pass all levels in one of the best piano games with real songs.<br><br> <b>UNIQUE MELODIES AND POPULAR SONGS</b><br>The beautiful piano game features mesmerizing EDM-inspired graphics and upbeat music. In this fun piano game for kids and adults, there are many famous reworks included. But unlike most piano games where there is a combo of piano and EDM, here there are also realistic drums and other instruments.<br><br><b>UNLOCK NEW SONGS</b><br>Collect stars with quick tapping after you successfully complete levels in the instrument rhythm game. Use them to unlock new packs of interesting songs that will play in the rhythm of the EDM game.<br><br> <font color=\"\u201dblue\u201d\">TAP PIANO GAME FEATURES: </font><br>- simple tap gameplay<br>- piano, drums, instrument game <br>- tap in the best spot at the right moment for extra points<br>- collect stars to unlock new song packs<br>- play the piano game online or offline (fun game for your travel, commute time, or anywhere where internet/mobile data is not available)<br><br>Now don\u2019t miss one of the best EDM music games of 2022! <br><br><b>Download Edm Music &amp; Piano Game for FREE</b><br><br><br>------------------------<br><u>REACH OUT</u> <br>- If some of the songs, labels, or images in our melody game are a subject of a dispute, don\u2019t hesitate to contact us",
